# GD-2 (round 19): L §4.2 day_of(m, n) takes an int day n for a month m; a month-day there is a value of the wrong
# type (LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index yrs = year 2026..2027
input file_by: monthday
input other: monthday


version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  file_by = 04-30
  other = 04-30
ask q: day_of(2026-05, file_by)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT day_of: the count is monthday (m.tally:20)
